  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>A family-run campsite in a wooded, countryside setting between the Mediterranean Sea and the Estérel massif, a few minutes from Cannes. A good base for exploring the Lérins Islands and their dog-friendly coves.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you book</h2>
      <p>Animals are welcome except for category 1 and 2 dogs and exotic pets. The campsite offers supervised activities for children in July-August, which also makes it a good family option.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: from Mandelieu, Cannes harbour and its shuttle boats to the Lérins Islands are just a few minutes' drive away.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Estérel massif, right next door, offers lovely walks among red rocks and pines, a good alternative to the beaches during the hottest hours.</p>
